506 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 284 0 R
/E (Our group carried out the study according to the project guidelines by having our group leader, Ryan, be the interviewer/researcher and the other two members of the group, John David and Wayne, be the interviewees. For the scope of the study to be limited, two specific 30 minute direct observation sessions of the Temu app were selected. We focused specifically on the interface problems that most impact the user, such as pop-up ads during a promotion, navigability of the application and technical performance.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
